<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/30/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue of a sum not exceeding two hundred and twenty-nine billion eighty million eight hundred and twelve thousand seven hundred ringgit (RM229,080,812,700) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2026 is hereby authorized and that sum is appropriated for the purposes specified in the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/30/eng@> .
